        {
            "guidStr": "a823ab47-4380-4662-81b9-4034efbe9c15",
            "name": [
                "Name",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isLive": false,
            "metadata": "",
            "deleted": false,
            "type": "Body",
            "topMarginOverride": -1,
            "bottomMarginOverride": -1,
            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "1. <indent=35>Resolve effects that occur at the start of activation. </indent>\r\n2. <indent=35>Resolve all required forfeitures of Normal Movement and Combat Action. You cannot use \"at any time\" abilities or forfeit your Normal Movement or Combat Action voluntarily before this step is resolved. </indent>\r\n3. <indent=35>Resolve effects that occur before Normal Movement. </indent>\r\n4. <indent=35>The model makes its Normal Movement. </indent>\r\n5. <indent=35>Resolve effects that occur at the end of Normal Movement. </indent>\r\n6. <indent=35>The model makes its Combat Action. </indent>\r\n7. <indent=35>Resolve effects that occur at the end of a model’s Combat Action. </indent>\r\n8. <indent=35>If activating a unit, repeat steps 6 and 7 for each trooper, then resolve effects that occur at the end of the unit’s Combat Action. </indent>",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "colorHex": "",
            "textColorHex": "",
            "mediaPath": "",
            "widthPerc": 85,
            "mediaWidth": 0,
            "mediaHeight": 0,
            "caption": [
                "",
