        {
            "guidStr": "1a82417d-cbb3-4600-8698-9d3f2b15cb7c",
            "name": [
                "Name",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isLive": false,
            "metadata": "",
            "deleted": false,
            "type": "Body",
            "topMarginOverride": -1,
            "bottomMarginOverride": -1,
            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "Models cannot use \"at any time\" abilities while resolving the attack sequence or while resolving triggered effects, including between new attacks triggered by the previous attack.\r\n1. <indent=35>Declare the attack and its target. </indent>\r\n2. <indent=35>Resolve effects that occur when a model is targeted by an attack. </indent>\r\n3. <indent=35>Check the range to the target. If the target is out of range, the attack automatically misses; do not make any attack rolls, and go to step 6. </indent>\r\n4. <indent=35>Resolve effects that cause an attack to hit or miss automatically. </indent>\r\n5. <indent=35>Make all attack rolls as dictated by the type of attack and its special rules. For example, a spray attack or Thresher special attack must go through the attack roll sequence for each model potentially hit before proceeding to step 6. </indent>",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "colorHex": "",
            "textColorHex": "",
            "mediaPath": "",
            "widthPerc": 85,
            "mediaWidth": 0,
            "mediaHeight": 0,
            "caption": [
