        {
            "guidStr": "a82adfdd-e3f4-454a-9d8c-2caf23fac81e",
            "name": [
                "Name",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isLive": false,
            "metadata": "",
            "deleted": false,
            "type": "Body",
            "topMarginOverride": -1,
            "bottomMarginOverride": -1,
            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "<indent=35>a. <indent=70>Resolve effects that change the number of dice rolled, such as boosting the roll. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>b. <indent=70>Roll the dice. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>c. <indent=70>Resolve effects that remove dice from the roll. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>d. <indent=70>Determine if the model would be hit or missed by the attack roll against it. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>e. <indent=70>Resolve effects that cause the attack roll to be rerolled. Return to step b if needed. When returning to step b, add all dice removed in step c back to the roll. </indent>\r\n<indent=0>6. <indent=35>Resolve effects that cause the attack to automatically hit a model other than the target. </indent>\r\n7. <indent=35>Resolve all other effects triggered by hitting or missing. </indent>\r\n8. <indent=35>Make all damage rolls resulting from the attack. </indent>",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "colorHex": "",
            "textColorHex": "",
            "mediaPath": "",
            "widthPerc": 85,
