            "bottomMarginOverride": -1,
            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "<indent=35>a. <indent=70>Resolve effects that change the number of dice rolled, such as boosting the roll. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>b. <indent=70>Roll the dice. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>c. <indent=70>Resolve effects that remove dice from the roll. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>d. <indent=70>Determine if the roll would damage the model. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>e. <indent=70>Resolve effects that cause the damage roll to be rerolled. Return to step b if needed. When returning to step b, add all dice removed in step c back to the roll. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>f. <indent=70>Resolve effects triggered by a damage roll that fails to exceed the ARM of a model hit. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>g. <indent=70>Resolve effects that trigger when a model \"would suffer damage\" such as damage transference. </indent>\r\n<indent=0>10. <indent=35>Apply all damage. </indent>",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
