        {
            "guidStr": "9f5f45db-4c9b-4b6b-aaea-567200aca87d",
            "name": [
                "Name",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isLive": false,
            "metadata": "",
            "deleted": false,
            "type": "Body",
            "topMarginOverride": -1,
            "bottomMarginOverride": -1,
            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "If an attack damaged more than one model, choose one model, follow the damage application sequence below, then repeat for each other damaged model.\r\n<indent=35>a. <indent=70>Resolve effects triggered by a model suffering damage. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>b. <indent=70>If all of a model’s damage boxes are marked, the model is disabled. Resolve effects triggered by the model becoming disabled. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>c. <indent=70>If the model is still disabled, it becomes boxed. Resolve effects triggered by the model becoming boxed. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>d. <indent=70>If the model is still boxed, it is destroyed. Resolved effects triggered by a model being destroyed. </indent>\r\n<indent=35>e. <indent=70>Remove the destroyed model from the table, then return to the main sequence. </indent>\r\n<indent=0>11. <indent=35>The attack is now resolved. </indent>\r\n12. <indent=35>Resolve active player effects that trigger \"after the attack is resolved\" that do not involve making another attack. </indent>\r\n13. <indent=35>Resolve all inactive player effects that trigger \"after the attack is resolved.\" </indent>\r\n14. <indent=35>Resolve active player effects that trigger \"after the attack is resolved\" that involve making an attack. </indent>",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "colorHex": "",
            "textColorHex": "",
            "mediaPath": "",
            "widthPerc": 85,
